### Add Booking
POST http://localhost:3000/booking
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
{
  "show_id": 1,
  "seat_id": 135
}

### Payment For Booking
POST http://localhost:3000/booking/pay
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
{
  "booking_id": 11
}

### Get Bookings
GET  http://localhost:3000/booking
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
